                                    <span class="h2-fs" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span class="oi text-o-color-1 o_anim_fade_in o_anim_from_left o_animate o_animate_on_scroll" data-icon="remove" style="--wanim-intensity: 40; animation-name: dummy;" data-scroll-zone-start="0" data-scroll-zone-end="60%"/></span><span class="o_animated_text o_anim_fade_in o_animate o_animate_on_scroll o_anim_from_bottom" style="--wanim-intensity: 20;" data-scroll-zone-start="0" data-scroll-zone-end="60%"><span class="h2-fs" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> Core Values &amp;amp; Commitments</span></span> <span class="h2-fs" style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span class="oi text-o-color-1 o_animate o_animate_on_scroll o_anim_fade_in o_anim_from_right" data-icon="remove" data-scroll-zone-start="0" data-scroll-zone-end="60%" style="--wanim-intensity: 40;"/></span>
                                </h2>
                                <p class="lead" style="text-align: center;">
                                    <span class="o_animated_text o_animate o_animate_on_scroll o_anim_fade_in o_anim_from_bottom" style="--wanim-intensity: 40;" data-scroll-zone-start="0" data-scroll-zone-end="60%">The principles behind every rig we build and every ticket we answer.</span>
                                </p>
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_anim_fade_in o_animate o_visible o_anim_from_left" style="--wanim-intensity: 10;">
                                        <div class="s_hr pt-4 pb32" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
