                                        </div>
                                        <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                            <img src="/web/image/it_hardware.img_it_hardware_image_21" alt="Icon quality" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="360" data-mimetype="image/webp" style="width: 20% !important;" loading="lazy"/>
                                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3 class="h5-fs">
                                                <span class="o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_underline" style="--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: 2px;">Obsessed with Quality</span>
                                            </h3>
                                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb8" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <p>Every component we offer undergoes rigorous stress testing. Whether it’s a cutting-edge GPU or a 3D rendering workstation, we only sell gear we would rely on ourselves.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible o_anim_from_bottom" style="--wanim-intensity: 10; animation-name: dummy;">
                                        <div class="s_hr pt-4 pb32" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                            <img src="/web/image/it_hardware.img_it_hardware_image_22" alt="Icon gamepad" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" style="width: 20% !important;" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="360" data-mimetype="image/webp" loading="lazy"/>
                                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3 class="h5-fs">
                                                <span class="o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_underline" style="--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: 2px;">Gamer Spirit, Pro Standard</span>
                                            </h3>
                                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb8" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <p>While gaming is in our DNA, our expertise reaches far beyond. We design configurations built for the heaviest workloads, 8K video editing, 3D modeling, AI development, and heavy multitasking.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in o_visible o_anim_from_right" style="--wanim-intensity: 10; animation-name: dummy;">
                                        <div class="s_hr pt-4 pb32" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="overflow-hidden">
                                            <img src="/web/image/it_hardware.img_it_hardware_image_23" alt="Icon helpdesk" class="img img-fluid o_we_custom_image" style="width: 20% !important;" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="360" data-mimetype="image/webp" loading="lazy"/>
                                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb24" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3 class="h5-fs">
                                                <span class="o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_underline" style="--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: 2px;">Support by Humans, for Humans</span>
                                            </h3>
                                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb8" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto" style="border-top-width: 0px;"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <p>No bots, no generic scripts. Our team of dedicated specialists is available 24/7 to diagnose, advise, and optimize your rig, both before and long after your purchase.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
